  "intentional_UI_and_behavior_differences": [
    "Default history tab instead of current alarms; current/device controls disabled and no device query dependency.",
    "One ordinary visible state label in original30px unused strip x14 y1 width925 height28; mouse-transparent, original12pt/#444444, no banner/new layout. Root explicitly approved.",
    "Queued SQL and <=32-row GUI append with genuine complete/cancel/failure status; original Query label temporarily取消查询 without changing button geometry.",
    "Original warning/calendar mask shown asynchronously; wait actual Store.closed before closing owner mask.",
    "Original date_timeDESC retained with Store-declared idDESC tie; preserve raw wall-time text/asterisks/duplicates, no timezone or severity conversion.",
    "Candidate visible10000row/16MiB limits fail closed and clear view; candidates are not original/accepted standards. Existing active theme and Windows visual match remain unverified."
  ],
